            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis looks like a bit too much and introduces a fair amount of special handling (like designing the ability for users to *actually* create a directory/file that matches used curly brackets syntax). Regular text editing tricks (like copy-pasting a line multiple times or editing several lines at once with blockwise Visual selection) should be enough.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
